go-acc
======

This directory contains a vendored copy of go-acc, a tool for reporting
accurate code coverage in Go, redistributed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. The full license text is in `LICENSE`.

  Upstream project: go-acc
  Upstream source:  https://github.com/ory/go-acc
  Go module path:   github.com/ory/go-acc
  Maintainer:       Ory Corp (https://www.ory.sh)
  License:          Apache License, Version 2.0

Copyright holder
----------------

Upstream go-acc does not state a copyright holder: its `LICENSE` is the
unmodified Apache-2.0 template, with the `Copyright [yyyy] [name of copyright
owner]` appendix left unfilled, and its source files carry no copyright
headers. That was verified against the upstream repository rather than
inferred from this copy.

No copyright line is asserted here, because doing so would attribute ownership
upstream has not claimed. Attribution is therefore recorded as the project and
its maintaining organisation above, which is the accurate statement of
provenance for this vendored code.
